---
modified: "2026-10-04"
title: "Downsizing & Later-Life Moving Advice UK | Chayce Blog"
description: "Practical UK guides on downsizing, moving an elderly parent, retirement villages, moving costs and settling in, from the Chayce team in Northampton."
bodyClass: "page-template page-loaded"
homeNav: false
navGlassy: false
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/blog/"
tags: []
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
headExtra: |
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-nav.css?v={{ build.version }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/chayce-blog.css?v={{ build.version }}">
---
{# Real /blog/ listing — separate from /news/, which stays exactly as it is
   today (3 static teasers, no real post pages). Same page-hero + news-card
   visual language as /news/ (src/css/chayce-blog.css), but this one is
   data-driven from collections.blog, so every card here is a real page. #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@context":"https://schema.org","itemListElement":[{"item":"https://chayceproperties.com/","name":"Home","@type":"ListItem","position":1},{"item":"https://chayceproperties.com/blog/","name":"Blog","@type":"ListItem","position":2}]}
</script>
{% if collections.blog.length > 0 %}
{# CollectionPage + ItemList generated from the same collection that renders the cards below, so the markup can never list a post the page doesn't show. #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CollectionPage","name":{{ title | dump | safe }},"description":{{ description | dump | safe }},"url":"https://chayceproperties.com/blog/","mainEntity":{"@type":"ItemList","itemListElement":[{% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}{"@type":"ListItem","position":{{ loop.index }},"url":"https://chayceproperties.com{{ post.url }}","name":{{ post.data.title | dump | safe }}}{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}{% endfor %}]}}
</script>
{% endif %}
<div class="page-hero" style="background-image:url({% imageUrl "chayce-blog-hero.webp" %});{% imageSet "chayce-blog-hero.webp" %};background-size:cover;background-position:center;">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <em>Blog</em></p>
    <h1><em>Chayce</em> Blog</h1>
    <p style="color:#ccc;margin-top:10px;font-size:16px;">Insights on senior relocation, downsizing, and moving with Chayce Properties</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="page-section">
  <div class="container">
    {% if collections.blog.length > 0 %}
    <div class="row">
      {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="news-card" style="margin-bottom:40px">
          {% if post.data.featuredImage %}
          <figure><img src="{{ post.data.featuredImage }}" alt="{{ post.data.featuredImageAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" width="940" height="650"></figure>
          {% endif %}
          <span>{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
          <h5><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h5>
          {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="color:#c8a96e;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none">Read More &rsaquo;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p style="color:#666;text-align:center;">New posts are coming soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
    <h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:30px;margin:0 0 20px">Guides by topic</h2>
    <p style="color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 16px">Downsizing: <a href="/blog/when-to-downsize-uk/">when to downsize</a>, <a href="/blog/downsizing-checklist-what-to-keep-uk/">a step-by-step downsizing guide and checklist</a>, <a href="/blog/how-to-declutter-a-parents-house/">decluttering a parent&rsquo;s house</a>, <a href="/blog/sentimental-belongings-when-downsizing/">sentimental belongings</a>, <a href="/blog/planning-furniture-and-floor-plan-for-a-smaller-home/">furniture for a smaller home</a> and <a href="/blog/downsizing-to-a-bungalow-uk/">downsizing to a bungalow</a> and <a href="/blog/what-to-look-for-in-a-smaller-home-uk/">what to look for in a smaller home</a>.</p>
    <p style="color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 16px">Costs and choosing movers: <a href="/blog/senior-move-cost-uk/">what a senior move costs</a>, <a href="/blog/cost-of-moving-house-uk/">the cost of moving house in the UK</a> and <a href="/blog/choosing-removals-company-for-elderly-person-uk/">how to choose a removals company for an elderly person</a>.</p>
    <p style="color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;margin:0 0 16px">Families: <a href="/moving-elderly-parent/">moving an elderly parent</a>, <a href="/blog/moving-house-with-dementia-in-the-family/">moving house when a family member has dementia</a>, <a href="/blog/later-life-relocation-closer-to-family-uk/">moving closer to family</a> and <a href="/blog/moving-an-elderly-person-into-a-care-home-checklist/">moving an elderly person into a care home</a>.</p>
    <p style="color:#555;font-size:17px;line-height:1.9;margin:0">Retirement housing and settling in: <a href="/blog/moving-into-a-retirement-village-uk-guide/">retirement village, flat or sheltered housing</a>, <a href="/blog/settling-in-after-your-move/">settling in</a> the <a href="/blog/uk-house-moving-checklist/">UK house moving checklist</a> and a <a href="/blog/change-of-address-checklist-uk/">change of address checklist</a>. Explained: <a href="/senior-move-manager-uk/">what is a senior move manager</a>. Questions? See the <a href="/senior-moving-faq/">senior moving FAQ</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

